<title>ITALY: Italy's Recordati H1 1996 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Italy's Recordati H1 1996 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian pharmaceutical group Recordati posted first half 1996 net profit of 12.8 billion lire, 35.2 percent up on the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>Operating profit fell by 13.4 percent to 12.7 billion lire, it said in a statement, but first half cash flow increased 19.8 percent to 23.3 billion lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
